<title>USA: Telecomm to buy back 6 pct of its shares.</title>
<headline>Telecomm to buy back 6 pct of its shares.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecomm Industries Corp said Tuesday it intends to buy 600,000 shares, or about six percent of the company's outstanding common stock, in a private transaction.</p>
<p>Chief executive James Lowery said in a statement the transaction will take place in the third quarter.</p>
<p>The company's stock traded at $0.29 Tuesday afternoon, up $0.04.</p>
</text>
